# Vaultra Landing — Environment Variables
#
# Waitlist email capture. Pick ONE option.
#
# Option A — Web3Forms (recommended; 5 min setup, no account required)
#   1. Visit https://web3forms.com
#   2. Enter your destination email, get an access key
#   3. Uncomment the line below and paste the key
#
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
#
# Option B — Formspree
#   1. Sign up at https://formspree.io
#   2. Create a form and copy the endpoint URL (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abc123)
#
# FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
#
# If neither is set, signups are logged to the server console (dev only).
